      "writtenOn": "2020-05-18T09:09:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just realised that I misread the line you commented on and in my initial reply I was talking about \".impl\" not \".stubs\". Sorry for any confusion.\n\nThe framework modules in rvc-dev (which I am trying to cover to use java_sdk_library) use direct access to the stubs because that is the only way that they can access them at the moment because they are not java_sdk_library. Switching them over to reference the java_sdk_library instead cannot be done until after conversion. Doing it during conversion would just make the changes too big, and error/conflict prone.\n\nThis test is just making sure that direct access to the stubs (which resolves to a java_library ) behaves in the same was as implicit reference (which resolves to a java_sdk_library). They go through separate code paths so need separate testing.",
      "parentUuid": "4fefb215_6373a66c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2449,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 2449,
        "endChar": 28
