      "writtenOn": "2020-05-20T05:40:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Once again, this change is not exposing stubs, they are already exposed. This change is simply testing to ensure that they work properly.\n\nYes, I am aware of this. But this change won\u0027t be needed when the direct dependencies to the stubs library is prohibited. I think this change is fixing the same problem in a different way.\n\nDoes this fix any existing place where \u003cuses-library\u003e is omitted mistakenly? If so, we should fix those places directly by simply dropping the \".stub\" suffix there.",
      "parentUuid": "e2f31a87_2efbf8df",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2449,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 2449,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "0facbe0cd76326d389c3e5c722577ca3f7db84f8",
