      "writtenOn": "2020-05-20T08:29:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just remembered that I need the functionality in this change in order to enable the follow up shared library change.\n\nThe reason I created this change was because I needed to make the tracking of sdk library usage dependent on whether the java_sdk_library was available to be used as a shared library or not. Prior to this change the decision as to whether to do that was based on whether a referenced module implemented SdkLibraryDependency. That was not sufficient, I also needed to be able to ask the SdkLibraryDependency whether it should be tracked.\n\nIt was while I was working on that refactoring that I noticed the hole in the build and so I fixed that as part of this. I should probably have split the refactoring out into a separate change but I didn\u0027t. So, if this is not submitted I would not just have to rebase around it I would have to extract the refactoring separately.",
      "parentUuid": "488e76ff_410145f7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2449,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 2449,
        "endChar": 28
      },
